// Task - Psimon_Omega_Mission_5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BloodVial 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3084226764" "Vial of Blood"
// DetailString :
"P3571294984" "This is a vial of Psimon Omega's blood to be delivered to Archmage Tarixus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BloodRune 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3008705817" "Runic Talisman"
// DetailString :
"P3935916234" "This is a stone talisman etched with blood and smeared with the blood of Psimon Omega. The Archmage Tarixus enchanted it as a key for mystic portal into Psimon's mind!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1505509313" "As vast as my intellect and prodigious as my mental powers are, I too have problems. Yes, I know it's hard to believe, considering I AM Psimon Omega. But psychic giants like myself have a new host of problems to deal with. Certainly, hearing the constant nattering of insignifigant minds on the edge of my perception is extremely annoying, but this pales in comparison to some of the larger issues. One of these issues is that of certain phobias which, if left unmanaged, would take on a life of themselves and tear my mind apart. I have been unable to deal with them myself as of yet, but have made a deal with another powerful entity of the Rogue Isles. He is known as Archmage Tarixus, and he possesses a ritual which will unlock a mystic gateway within the ancient gateways found on Primeva. This gateway will act as a gateway to the darker portions of my mind! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Take this vial of my blood to Tarixus, then take the ritual stone to the mystic portal and destroy my phobias within!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1571188456" "Destroy Psimon's phobias"
// SendOffString :
"P13645722" "The phobias will manifest as threats you may have faced in the past, but they will likely treat you as an extension of myself. It may get a little weird. Pay no heed to what they say."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Psimon_Omega_Mission_5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3917928140" "Deliver blood to Tarixus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3438620117" "My blood is starting to congeal in the vial. Deliver it to Tarixus!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3322200972" "You receive a vial of blood."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1049158831" "I sensed your arrival. You have the blood of Psimon Omega, and you wish to use it to unlock a mystic portal in Primeva. Yes, I can do this. Psimon will make good on this arrangement, for he knows he suffers a far worse fate if fails to do so.<br><br>There, the ritual is complete. Take this talisman and travel now to the mystic cave in Primeva. It will lead into the depths of Psimon's mind."

